# ProgramCreator — Cursor Rules (v4 FINAL)

## Business
- Brand: ProgramCreator. Agency arm of a personal brand. One-person studio (Daive, @daivescales). First person singular only. No "team" / "we deliver".
- Service: Creator Product Scaling. Partner with people who already have attention; build what that attention should point at.
- Lane A (creators/digital): product + converting page, scaled via their socials. Payment: revenue split, nothing upfront.
- Lane B (physical): storefront rebuild + social→site. Payment: monthly retainer.
- Same work both lanes; payment is the only difference. Say it plainly.
- Availability: limited spots, first come first served. NEVER state a specific number of open slots anywhere.

## Writing (hard requirement — human, not generated)
BANNED punctuation/structure:
- Em dash "—" anywhere (copy, headings, labels, legal, metadata). Use period, comma, colon, or brackets.
- En dashes in prose (hyphen only in ranges like 5k-25k).
- "it's not just X, it's Y" · three-adjective lists · rhetorical-question headings
- "But here's the thing" / "The truth is" / "Let's be honest" / "Imagine" openers
- Semicolons in marketing copy
Banned words: unlock, elevate, empower, leverage, synergy, revolutionize, seamless, cutting edge, game changer, transformative, bespoke, curated, journey, ecosystem, "in today's landscape", "we're passionate about", "take it to the next level", "let's build something amazing".
Write: first person, short declaratives, varied length, specific over impressive, blunt OK, occasional And/So. No ! No emoji.

## Layout — editorial print / dossier
BANNED: 3-col icon cards, bento, decorative pills, centred hero+2 CTAs, floating shadow cards, "Our Services/Process/Why Us", gradients, emoji/blobs/generated imagery.
USE: Spine (lg 12-col, rail cols 1–2 sticky number+vertical label, content 3–12; mobile horizontal rail) · rules not boxes · radius 0 everywhere · type is design · tabular indexes/tables · asymmetry (only Final CTA centred) · Signature in About + Footer.

## HandUnderline — THE signature flourish
Reusable SVG under a word: hand-drawn cubic path (not straight), dips mid, lifts ends, right overshoot 3–5%, slight -0.6deg rotation, stroke --pc-accent, round caps, pathLength draw 0.7s after heading reveal (~0.25s delay), 3 path variants, thickness/color props. Reduced motion = already drawn.
USE EXACTLY: 4× on landing (hero, lanes heading, FAQ heading, Final CTA) + once in apply terms step + nav link hover. Nowhere else. Scarcity matters.

## Colour
--pc-navy-900 #071528 · --pc-navy-800 #0B2038 · --pc-navy-700 #102C4C · --pc-navy-600 #16395F
--pc-line rgba(255,255,255,0.09) · --pc-line-2 rgba(255,255,255,0.18)
--pc-white #FFF · --pc-text #C2D4E8 · --pc-muted #94AAC4 · --pc-accent #4D9BFF · --pc-accent-2 #A9CDFF · --pc-glow rgba(77,155,255,0.22)
Accent only: HandUnderlines, primary CTA, section numbers, active states. Max ~4 accent elements/screen.

## Type
Inter Tight 400/500/600/700. Instrument Serif italic ONLY for emphasis + signature (~4 uses). Never body/buttons/labels.
display clamp(2.75rem,8vw,6.5rem) · h2 clamp(2rem,5vw,3.75rem) · body 17px max-w-[58ch] · label 11px tracking-[0.2em]

## Motion — restrained
NO: mockups, SVG diagrams, marquees, rotating words, counters, pulse dots, parallax, custom cursor, scramble/glitch, Lenis/GSAP/ScrollTrigger/locomotive, pin, scrub.
ONLY: MaskText, MaskLines, Reveal, RuleDraw, StaggerList, HandUnderline, IndexRow, MagneticButton (≤5px), ScrollProgress scaleX.
Scroll: one-shot whileInView once margin "-12%" only. Animate transform+opacity only.
Ease in [0.16,1,0.3,1] · out [0.65,0,0.35,1] · micro 160 / standard 480 / display 800.
Reduced motion: 0.15s opacity, underlines static. Text in DOM without JS.

## Texture
Grain 3.5% sitewide. Static Glow behind hero + Final CTA only. Nothing else.

## Site map
/ (7 blocks: Hero, Model, Lanes, Process, AboutStrip, FAQ, FinalCTA) · /apply · /book · /legal · /terms · /privacy · /cookies · /disclaimer
Every CTA → /apply. Labels: "Apply to work with me" / "How it works".

## Tech
Next 15 App Router, TS strict, Tailwind, Framer Motion, lucide-react. Server Components default; motion as leaves.
Config in site-config.ts. No lorem. No stock people. 375/768/1440. AA, focus-visible accent, labelled inputs.
TODOs only: Daive photo, governing law, cookie analytics update.
